  "importantCrossCollectionRules": [
    "Firebase Authentication UID is the common identity key",
    "users is authoritative for registered-user and OKU eligibility data",
    "violations is authoritative for active/resolved violation state and navbar counts",
    "notifications and violations share the same deterministic document ID and should be written/resolved together",
    "parking_simulation/current is authoritative for current simulated occupancy",
    "parking_occupancy_history is append-only history used for traffic aggregation",
    "Cloudinary is authoritative for image bytes; Firestore holds references",
    "Number plates must be normalized before equality checks and document lookup"
